                0.005 millisieverts per hour)
            ]
          } ##(Now we connect all the dots. Two serialized products connected to po RE123099 
          undergo an inspection at a specific location. So the  sensor records an effective radiation 
          dose rate of 0.005 millisieverts per hour, and the products are documented as needing replacement.

          So what? EPCIS connects the products, purchase order, inspection location, sensor measurement, and 
          replacement status in one traceable record. This can accelerate replacement decisions, improve 
          supplier communication, support audits, and prevent affected products from continuing through the 
          supply chain.)
        ]
